{'symbol': 'F', 'date': '2019-11-07 22:30:00', 'title': 'Ford Announces New Executive Leaders For Sustainability/Safety, AV, Strategy, Ford Credit', 'text': 'Nov 7  - Ford Motor Co <F.N>::FORD MOTOR CO - FORD ANNOUNCES NEW EXECUTIVE LEADERS FOR SUSTAINABILITY/SAFETY, AV, STRATEGY, AND FORD CREDIT.FORD MOTOR CO - KIM PITTEL, JIM HOLLAND RETIRING AFTER 30-PLUS YEARS EACH WITH FORD.FORD MOTOR CO - JOHN LAWLER, DAVID MCCLELLAND TAKE ON NEW SENIOR-LEVEL ROLES.FORD MOTOR CO - BOB HOLYCROSS, MARION HARRIS AND CHUCK GRAY APPOINTED CORPORATE OFFICERS.FORD - KIM PITTEL, VP OF SUSTAINABILITY, ENVIRONMENT AND SAFETY ENGINEERING, HAS ELECTED TO RETIRE EFFECTIVE DEC. 1.FORD - JOHN LAWLER IS MOVING TO A NEW POSITION AS CEO, FORD AUTONOMOUS VEHICLES LLC, AND VP, MOBILITY PARTNERSHIPS.FORD -  DAVID MCCLELLAND TO BE VICE PRESIDENT, STRATEGY.FORD MOTOR CO - MARION HARRIS HAS BEEN NAMED CORPORATE OFFICER AND SUCCESSOR TO DAVID MCCLELLAND AS CEO OF FORD CREDIT.'}
